google/fnet-base,505159,pretraining,downloads:desc,2024-02-29T09:54:11.000Z,2022-03-02T23:29:05.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,,Pretrained model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) and next sentence prediction (NSP) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.03824) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/f_net). This model is cased: it makes a difference between english and English. The model achieves 0.58 accuracy on MLM objective and 0.80 on NSP objective.,apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/google/fnet-base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,21,,transformers,false
MCG-NJU/videomae-base,372808,pretraining,downloads:desc,2024-03-29T08:02:16.000Z,2022-08-03T09:27:59.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,video-classification,VideoMAE model pre-trained on Kinetics-400 for 1600 epochs in a self-supervised way. It was introduced in the paper [VideoMAE: Masked Autoencoders are Data-Efficient Learners for Self-Supervised Video Pre-Training](https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.12602) by Tong et al. and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/MCG-NJU/VideoMAE).,cc-by-nc-4.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/MCG-NJU/videomae-base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,59,,transformers,false
