cointegrated/rubert-tiny2,283488,pretraining,downloads:desc,2025-12-30T08:33:24.000Z,2022-03-02T23:29:05.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,18,sentence-similarity,This is an updated version of [cointegrated/rubert-tiny](https://huggingface.co/cointegrated/rubert-tiny): a small Russian BERT-based encoder with high-quality sentence embeddings. This [post in Russian](https://habr.com/ru/post/669674/) gives more details.,mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/cointegrated/rubert-tiny2,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,183,,sentence-transformers,false
