RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-422M-hg38,2315,pretrained,downloads:desc,2024-05-31T20:39:34.000Z,2024-05-29T14:38:26.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,text-generation,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-422M-hg38 Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 422M parameters. It is derived from Mixtral-8x7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10kb DNA sequences from the hg38 human genome assembly.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-422M-hg38,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,3,,transformers,false
