DhruvParmar051/syrinx-10m,378,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-10-14T17:36:06.000Z,2026-10-14T17:31:18.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,text-generation,"The smallest Syrinx model: a decoder-only transformer trained from scratch on TinyStories, a corpus of short synthetic children's stories. It is the first of three models (10M, 50M, 125M) in a scaling series and exists to validate the training, evaluation and export pipeline end to end.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/DhruvParmar051/syrinx-10m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
Diamegs/PIT-4B-201312,377,pretrained,downloads:desc,2026-09-14T16:02:42.000Z,2026-04-23T15:24:16.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,text-generation,"**Point-In-Time (PIT)** is a family of GPT-style language models trained on chronologically-ordered monthly snapshots of [FineWeb](https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb). Each checkpoint captures the state of knowledge available up to a specific month, making them suitable for temporal reasoning and point-in-time analysis tasks.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Diamegs/PIT-4B-201312,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
