Compactbot/catgirl-1m,361,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-09-28T13:51:15.000Z,2026-09-28T11:12:24.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,23,text-generation,"A **1,064,737-parameter** tsundere-catgirl conversational persona model. A full fine-tune of the community's [Glint-2](https://huggingface.co/Glint-Research/Glint-2) looped-block base, trained on a ~216 KB synthetic `User:`/`Cat:` dialogue corpus of tsundere-catgirl chatter.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Compactbot/catgirl-1m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
Crawlnet/queen-v6,361,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-10-14T20:26:48.000Z,2026-10-14T20:26:29.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,9,text-generation,"A small language model trained **from scratch**. **Pretraining data: pages the Crawlnet crawlers read on the crypto web** (real browsers; 65% of the tokens trained), **public market, funding and on-chain records written out as plain-text pages** (4%), **study notes a general-purpose LLM wrote for 153,245 of those pages** (24%) and **question/answer pairs a general-purpose LLM generated from those pages** (7%); details in Pretraining data below. **Tokenizer: trained on this dataset's pages only (crawler pages and record pages).** No pretrained weights, no FineWeb, no other corpus. **Chat tuning: question/answer pairs generated by a general-purpose LLM from those pages (with the study notes' own Q&A), pairs cut from the pages and open-book conversations that answer from retrieved pages with",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Crawlnet/queen-v6,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,nanochat,false
