nkthebass/tinybrainbot-360m-a75m-v4.1-moe-base,326,pretrained,downloads:desc,2026-10-19T18:02:10.000Z,2026-10-17T05:28:59.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,28,text-generation,"A **mixture-of-experts** language model trained from scratch on two Tesla V100s. Every layer holds **24 experts** and each token uses **4** of them, so the model stores **359M** parameters but runs only **75.7M per token** (non-embedding; plus a 24.6M tied embedding, 383M in total). It was trained on **18.2B tokens** with a **2,048-token** context, then given one **expert-tuned patch** for factual question answering (below).",apache-2.0,,,6,https://huggingface.co/nkthebass/tinybrainbot-360m-a75m-v4.1-moe-base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
