Compactbot/compacttest-5m,302,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-09-22T16:10:50.000Z,2026-09-22T09:26:08.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,20,text-generation,"A small subword language model trained **from scratch on CPU**, built to the ""GPT-X2.5"" style spec requested in the [model-requests](https://huggingface.co/Compactbot/model-requests) board (`gpt-S2.5-5m`). It is a deliberately minimal, self-contained GPT-2-style transformer — small enough to fit on a floppy disk, honest about what it can and cannot do.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Compactbot/compacttest-5m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
hotdogs/Qwen3.8-27B-abliterated-cyber-preview,301,mcp,downloads:desc,2026-08-21T03:31:11.000Z,2026-08-19T18:54:37.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,19,image-text-to-text,"An **offensive-security / agentic tool-calling** LoRA merge on top of — the training-free abliterated build of [Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B). The LoRA is **merged** into the base at **scale 1.0** (PEFT `alpha/r = 64/32 = 2.0`, i.e. the exact strength the scale sweep below found optimal), and the **MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) head is preserved**, so the GGUF build supports self-speculative decoding.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/hotdogs/Qwen3.8-27B-abliterated-cyber-preview,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,5,,transformers,false
