altslate/JugnuLM-110M,299,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-14T16:41:31.000Z,2026-09-06T10:34:17.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,text-generation,"A **109.7M parameter**, **deep-and-thin** language model pretrained **from scratch** on ~8B tokens of FineWeb-Edu. It is the larger sibling of [JugnuLM-53M](https://huggingface.co/altslate/JugnuLM-53M) and the **baseline rung of an ongoing ablation study** on what improves sub-150M models. *Jugnu* (जुगनू) = firefly.",apache-2.0,,,6,https://huggingface.co/altslate/JugnuLM-110M,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
