metavoiceio/metavoice-1B-v0.1,296,pretrained,downloads:desc,2024-04-03T10:30:14.000Z,2024-02-06T17:02:48.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,6,text-to-speech,"MetaVoice-1B is a 1.2B parameter base model trained on 100K hours of speech for TTS (text-to-speech). It has been built with the following priorities: * Emotional speech rhythm and tone in English. No hallucinations. * Support for voice cloning with finetuning. * We have had success with as little as 1 minute training data for Indian speakers. * Zero-shot cloning for American & British voices, with 30s reference audio. * Support for long-form synthesis.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/metavoiceio/metavoice-1B-v0.1,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,789,,metavoice,false
