Mercity/pretrain-longcat-ngram-25pct,249,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-09-28T08:23:25.000Z,2026-09-28T07:59:48.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,text-generation,"A ~1B-parameter Llama 3-style decoder that spends about 25% of its parameter budget on hashed n-gram embedding tables, following the [LongCat n-gram embedding module](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.21204). To keep the total near 1B, it has 23 transformer layers instead of the [baseline's](https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-baseline-qknorm) 32. Everything else matches the baseline, including the 6B FineWeb training tokens.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-longcat-ngram-25pct,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
