Mercity/pretrain-kda-1b,241,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-09-28T08:23:19.000Z,2026-09-28T07:56:43.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,13,text-generation,"A dense ~1B-parameter Llama 3-style decoder where one attention layer in every four is Kimi Delta Attention (KDA), a linear-attention layer from [Kimi Linear](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.26692). It is otherwise identical to the [QK-norm baseline](https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-baseline-qknorm) and was trained on the same 6B FineWeb tokens.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Mercity/pretrain-kda-1b,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
