adiitya0929/TinySQL-125M-WikiSQL,237,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-10-16T07:04:26.000Z,2026-10-16T07:03:28.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,17,text-generation,"A 125M-parameter text-to-SQL model. Given a table schema and a question, it writes the SQL query. Every part of it was built from scratch: the tokenizer, the transformer, the optimizer, the training loop and the data pipeline. It was pretrained on 4.5B tokens on one GPU, then fine-tuned on WikiSQL.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/adiitya0929/TinySQL-125M-WikiSQL,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
