fausap/pico-165m,199,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-10-14T20:17:41.000Z,2026-10-14T20:01:46.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,25,text-generation,"Pico is a 165M-parameter model trained from scratch on about 2.7B tokens on a single TPU chip. It is built for **multi-turn memory**: remembering what the user said, keeping standing instructions (""call me Captain"", ""end every reply with 'cheers'"") and noticing false premises. Instead of reading the whole conversation, it works as a **resident agent**: - a note-taker turns each user message into `rule:` and `fact:` notes; - the answerer sees only those notes and the last two exchanges.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/fausap/pico-165m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,,false
