 CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE. --- Note: this license covers the modeling/configuration code in this repository, which is derived from karpathy/nanochat. The model weights are a separate artifact; see README.md for the weight license and training-data terms (ClimbMix, CC BY-NC 4.0, research and development only).",,tag,0,,transformers,false
