Welmia/welmia-1.0-81m,115,pretrained,downloads:desc,2026-08-22T13:26:54.000Z,2026-08-06T15:27:16.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,30,text-generation,"**Welmia 1.0 81M** is a lightweight, **81-million-parameter** causal language model, trained **completely from scratch** — original architecture implementation, from-random-initialization pretraining, no borrowed backbone — using a **TinyLLaMA-inspired** design: **RoPE** positional encoding, **RMSNorm**, **SwiGLU** feed-forward layers, and full **KV-cache streaming** for fast token-by-token generation. It's instruction-tuned to follow Alpaca-style prompts, and small enough to run comfortably on CPU.",apache-2.0,,,6,https://huggingface.co/Welmia/welmia-1.0-81m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
