sofieneb/omni-base,82,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-10-15T21:36:07.000Z,2026-09-22T14:17:47.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,image-feature-extraction,"**OMNI-B** is a 114M-parameter pathology vision encoder distilled from **10 state-of-the-art pathology foundation models** at once. Instead of compressing all teachers into a single CLS token (vanilla multi-teacher distillation), OMNI learns **one token per teacher**, together with a structured attention mask, Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) layers and a per-teacher contrastive loss. This lets distillation keep improving as more teachers are added.",cc-by-nc-4.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/sofieneb/omni-base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
