IvmeLabs/ExpIvme-DiffusionConversate-v1,75,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-08-02T15:51:23.000Z,2026-08-02T15:10:07.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,25,text-generation,"**İvme** (Turkish: *acceleration*) is normally a series of small autoregressive language models. This is not one of those. This is the same architecture family run through a different objective entirely: a masked/absorbing-state discrete diffusion language model instead of next-token prediction. ""Exp"" is doing real work in the name — this is an experiment to see what a small dSLM (diffusion small language model) can do at a scale we can train on one GPU in an afternoon, not a production model.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/IvmeLabs/ExpIvme-DiffusionConversate-v1,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,4,,transformers,false
