zachwallace/bonsai-sapling-v1-290m-instruct,71,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-09-06T19:37:30.000Z,2026-09-06T19:21:13.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,text-generation,"Hi guys, I'm a high school student with a strong interest in AI and ML, and I wanted to create a model myself to better understand the process. This model is a 290 million parameter decoder-only transformer, and took around 30 days to pretrain on my Macbook Pro M5 Pro with 48GB of RAM. I wanted to make this project the most 'from scratch' as possible to do by myself, so the transformer, BPE tokenizer, data pipeline, and AdamW optimzer are all original implementations.",cc-by-sa-3.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/zachwallace/bonsai-sapling-v1-290m-instruct,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,mlx,false
