rohitnagareddy/AdbhutMOE,52,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2025-06-12T05:57:19.000Z,2025-06-12T05:57:09.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,13,text-generation,"**AdbhutMOE** is a miniature, from-scratch Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) autoregressive language model based on the Mixtral architecture. This model was pre-trained on a sample of the `ag_news` dataset as part of a learning exercise to demonstrate the end-to-end pipeline for creating a sparse foundation model.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/rohitnagareddy/AdbhutMOE,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
