KuanP/brain-uce-pilot-mix-v2,51,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-09-23T19:29:54.000Z,2026-09-23T19:29:20.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,feature-extraction,"A pilot **Universal Cell Embedding (UCE)-style** model for brain single-cell RNA-seq, trained from scratch on ""data mix v2"" (the `v2026-09` corpus): **26 caches, 147,675,214 cells, 13 species, 43.1 % brain tissue**. It maps a cell's raw counts to a 512-d, L2-normalised embedding through a chromosome-ordered ""cell sentence"" of frozen ESM2 gene tokens.",other,,,3,https://huggingface.co/KuanP/brain-uce-pilot-mix-v2,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,uce_suite,false
