oddadmix/Nawah-50M-Egyptian-18y-Persona,51,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-07-11T21:29:08.000Z,2026-06-30T13:49:34.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,20,text-generation,"**Nawah (نواة, ""nucleus/seed"")** is a **~51.8M-parameter** Arabic small language model fine-tuned to speak with the voice of an **18-year-old Egyptian persona**. It is a proof-of-concept for training capable Arabic models **from scratch at tiny scale** — small enough to run on a CPU, yet coherent in Modern Standard Arabic with an Egyptian cultural frame.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/oddadmix/Nawah-50M-Egyptian-18y-Persona,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
