antichronology/orthrus-mlm-6-track,50,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-05-28T16:57:47.000Z,2026-05-10T23:21:51.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,feature-extraction,"10M-param Mamba RNA encoder, dual-objective pretrained (contrastive + masked LM). Adds a per-position MLM head on top of the standard Orthrus backbone. Use `representation()` / `representation_unpooled()` for embeddings; use `predict_tokens()` for per-position nucleotide log-likelihoods (variant scoring).",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/antichronology/orthrus-mlm-6-track,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
