RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-virus,46,pretrained,downloads:desc,2024-11-27T07:57:47.000Z,2024-11-27T07:51:00.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-virus Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA text model with 17.31M parameters x 8 experts = 138.5M parameters. It is derived from Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using around 15071 viruses > 1kb. Virus genomes were split into 1kb sequences.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-virus,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
