RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-bacteriophage,35,pretrained,downloads:desc,2024-11-24T22:04:49.000Z,2024-11-19T13:26:35.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-bacteriophage Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA text model with 17.31M parameters x 8 experts = 138.5M parameters. It is derived from Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 30405 bacteriophage genomes > 10kb.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-bacteriophage,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-noncoding,35,pretrained,downloads:desc,2024-11-30T08:17:07.000Z,2024-11-30T08:12:07.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,,"The Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-noncoding Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA text model with 17.31M parameters x 8 experts = 138.5M parameters. It is derived from Mistral-7B-v0.1 model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using around 1940736 non coding RNAs > 100b from rfam database. Sequences were split into 100b sequences.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/RaphaelMourad/Mistral-DNA-v1-138M-noncoding,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
