AnReu/math_pretrained_bert,35,pretraining,downloads:desc,2024-12-11T18:58:19.000Z,2022-09-20T09:42:36.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,,This repository contains our pre-trained BERT-based model. It was initialised from BERT-base-cased and further pre-trained on Math StackExchange in three different stages. We also added more LaTeX tokens to the tokenizer to enable a better tokenization of mathematical formulas. This model is not yet fine-tuned on a specific task.,,,,3,https://huggingface.co/AnReu/math_pretrained_bert,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,9,,transformers,false
Gaolaboratory/iona-base-200m,35,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-09-26T10:13:35.000Z,2026-09-23T20:04:28.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,feature-extraction,Iona is a transformer encoder foundation model for tandem mass spectra (MS/MS). It treats each centroided peak as a token and learns how peaks relate to each other through a per-head attention bias over the signed m/z difference (Δm/z) between every pair of peaks.,apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Gaolaboratory/iona-base-200m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
Gaolaboratory/iona-contrastive-50m,35,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-09-26T10:25:15.000Z,2026-09-25T04:28:59.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,13,feature-extraction,"iona-contrastive-50m embeds tandem mass spectra (MS/MS) so that spectra of the same peptide and charge state lie close together. It is the Iona 50m encoder fine-tuned with a supervised contrastive objective, and is suited to spectrum-to-spectrum search and clustering.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Gaolaboratory/iona-contrastive-50m,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
ucrelnlp/PyMUSAS-Neural-Multilingual-Base-BEM,34,mcp,downloads:desc,2026-01-19T09:58:47.000Z,2025-12-01T17:09:19.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,1823,,A fine tuned 307 Million (307M) parameter Multilingual ModernBERT architecture semantic tagger. The tagger outputs semantic tags at the token level from the [USAS tagset](https://ucrel.lancs.ac.uk/usas/usas_guide.pdf).,cc-by-nc-sa-4.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/ucrelnlp/PyMUSAS-Neural-Multilingual-Base-BEM,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,,false
orzattyholdings/Sylor-S2-Pro,34,mcp,downloads:desc,2026-09-02T18:43:53.000Z,2026-08-25T19:00:29.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,text-generation,"**Sylor S2 Pro** es un modelo de lenguaje masivo Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) desarrollado por **Orzatty** (Puerto Ordaz, Venezuela). Está optimizado para la resolución autónoma de problemas de ingeniería de software, automatización de entornos de terminal y orquestación de herramientas mediante el protocolo **MCP (Model Context Protocol)**.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/orzattyholdings/Sylor-S2-Pro,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,llama.cpp,false
