RaphaelMourad/ModernBERT-DNA-v1-37M-Athaliana,33,pretrained,downloads:desc,2025-03-09T17:22:11.000Z,2025-03-09T17:17:43.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,8,,"The ModernBERT-DNA-v1-37M-Athaliana Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 37M parameters. It is derived from ModernBERT model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 10kb DNA sequences from 7 A. thaliana genome assemblies (from https://1001genomes.org/data/MPIPZ/MPIPZJiao2020/releases/current/full_set/).",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/RaphaelMourad/ModernBERT-DNA-v1-37M-Athaliana,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
