0arch-io/kisoku-1.6b,28,pretrained,downloads:desc,2026-10-07T23:37:44.000Z,2026-10-07T23:36:08.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,25,text-generation,"Kisoku 1.6B is a base (not chat) language model pretrained from random initialization by one person, Joseph Rodriguez at 0ARCH, on a TPU v4-32 from Google's TPU Research Cloud. It has 1,600,749,056 parameters, saw about 0.5 trillion tokens of pretraining text (524.4B including the long-context phases), and was extended to 64K tokens of context. All numbers below come from the technical report draft (draft 4, 2026-10-07) and were measured by me on my own hardware.",apache-2.0,,,6,https://huggingface.co/0arch-io/kisoku-1.6b,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
