sraivante/TinyThinkModel-72M-V1,24,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-10-18T04:27:56.000Z,2026-10-18T03:48:19.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,15,text-generation,"**Experimental research model by sraivante. Built with Llama (applicable synthetic training-data attribution).** The repository identifier is `TinyThinkModel-72M-V1`. Exactly **72,000,000 parameters**, **1,024-token context**, and a **33,069-token custom byte-level BPE**. Model weights and tokenizer were trained from scratch. The Qwen3-0.6B architecture was a design reference; no pretrained Qwen weights or tokenizer were used. The internal training project was called Think72.",other,tinythinkmodel-research-and-upstream-terms,LICENSE,3,https://huggingface.co/sraivante/TinyThinkModel-72M-V1,noassertion,yes,LICENSE,LICENSE,full,file_only,"TinyThinkModel-72M-V1: research and upstream license terms For original model-weight contributions owned by sraivante, permission is granted to download, run, study, modify and share the model for non-commercial research, retaining this notice, model identity, attribution and applicable upstream terms. This grant cannot override rights held by third parties and does not grant commercial-use rights for the model weights. Copyright (c) 2026 sraivante applies to original project code, documentation and original dataset selection/arrangement only. These original contributions are licensed under Apache License 2.0; see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. This does not relicense third-party data or put the trained model weights under Apache-2.0. AM-DeepSeek-R1-Distilled-1.4M is marked CC-BY-NC-4.0 and its authors specify research-only use. NVIDIA data carries per-record CC-BY, ODC-BY or CC-BY-SA terms and references Llama 3.1/3.3 obligations for applicable synthetic material. Mixture-of-Thoughts incorporates multiple upstream components. Each component's original terms, notices and attribution continue to apply. Model/data access does not imply that commercial reuse or blanket relicensing is permitted