mbsdeepak/scribe,18,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-08-16T05:38:18.000Z,2026-08-16T05:38:06.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,text-generation,"A **~30M-parameter small language model built from scratch in PyTorch** and trained on [TinyStories](https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories). It's a decoder-only GPT — hand-written multi-head causal attention, pre-LayerNorm blocks, GELU MLP, tied LM head — with no `transformers`/`nanoGPT` modelling code. The architecture is deliberately **GPT-2-compatible**, so these weights load directly into [`ember`](https://github.com/mbsdeepak/ember), a from-scratch LLM inference server.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/mbsdeepak/scribe,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,pytorch,false
