Charles59/lens-pretrained,17,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-06-29T16:38:28.000Z,2026-06-26T14:47:48.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,17,,"Pretrained checkpoint of **Lens**, a knowledge-guided foundation model for network traffic (TMLR). The backbone is **T5-v1.1-base** (~0.25B params) with a network-specific **BBPE tokenizer** (vocab 32,112), pretrained on network-traffic flows with a knowledge-guided masked-span objective.",cc-by-nc-4.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Charles59/lens-pretrained,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
ShuaiAnwo/pore-codec-rsq742c36a-519,17,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-06-30T03:33:48.000Z,2026-06-30T03:32:26.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,22,feature-extraction,**PoreCodec-RSQ742C36A** is a lightweight neural codec for nanopore electrical signals. It converts continuous ionic current measurements into discrete token sequences while preserving the original temporal resolution of the signal. The model combines a fully convolutional dilated encoder with a production-oriented **Residual Finite Scalar Quantization (Residual FSQ)** module to generate hierarchical discrete representations suitable for downstream foundation models.,apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/ShuaiAnwo/pore-codec-rsq742c36a-519,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
