RaphaelMourad/ModernBERT-Codon-v1-34M,16,pretrained,downloads:desc,2025-03-09T08:56:23.000Z,2025-03-07T15:28:30.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,7,,"The ModerBert-Codon-v1-34M Large Language Model (LLM) is a pretrained generative DNA sequence model with 34M parameters. It is derived from ModernBERT model, which was simplified for DNA: the number of layers and the hidden size were reduced. The model was pretrained using 24M coding DNA sequences (3000bp) from many different species (vertebrates, plants, bacteria, viruses, ...).",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/RaphaelMourad/ModernBERT-Codon-v1-34M,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
