claudios/cubert-20210711-Python-1024,15,pretraining,downloads:desc,2024-05-07T07:31:19.000Z,2024-04-30T19:38:32.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,fill-mask,"This model is the unofficial HuggingFace version of ""[CuBERT](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/cubert)"". In particular, this version comes from [gs://cubert/20210711_Python/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_1024](https://console.cloud.google.com/storage/browser/cubert/20210711_Python/pre_trained_model_epochs_2__length_1024). It was trained 2021-07-11 for 2 epochs with a 1024 token context window on the Python BigQuery dataset. I manually converted the Tensorflow checkpoint to PyTorch and have uploaded it here. The [tokenizer](https://github.com/google-research/google-research/blob/master/cubert/python_tokenizer.py) has not been converted yet. All credit goes to Aditya Kanade, Petros Maniatis, Gogul Balakrishnan, and Kensen Shi.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/claudios/cubert-20210711-Python-1024,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
