Paerle/GUIDO_test_200M,10,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-05-28T14:54:26.000Z,2026-05-28T14:54:04.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,text-generation,"A 195M-parameter math/code-oriented language model, pretrained from scratch on a math-heavy corpus. Custom architecture (Vathos PiCOFormer): gated attention, smear-gate, identity-at-init, UDLP MLP, RoPE, tied embeddings, fp32-master weights with bf16 autocast.",other,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Paerle/GUIDO_test_200M,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,pytorch,false
