castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-bidirectional-20260929,10,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-17T14:20:03.000Z,2026-09-30T18:00:51.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,13,,"The bidirectional variant of [`castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-20260924`](https://huggingface.co/castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-20260924), described in the pre-training section of ([PDF](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.11922)). Our GPU budget did not allow a second pre-training run, so we obtained it by converting the causal model, following LLM2Vec: starting from the causal checkpoint at 245B tokens, we trained it on the remaining 42B tokens of the corpus with bidirectional attention and masked next-token prediction (MNTP). It is a base model; no instruction or embedding tuning has been applied.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/castorini/gaggle-nanochat-pretrained-climbmix-bidirectional-20260929,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,2,,nanochat,false
