simonykq/nvidia-transaction-decoder-fm,8,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-08-12T04:33:20.000Z,2026-08-12T04:32:29.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,feature-extraction,"Pretrained checkpoint from the [NVIDIA Build Your Own Transaction Foundation Model](https://github.com/NVIDIA-AI-Blueprints/transaction-foundation-model) developer example, as described in the [NVIDIA Technical Blog](https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/build-your-own-transaction-foundation-model-for-financial-intelligence/).",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/simonykq/nvidia-transaction-decoder-fm,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v17,8,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-09-03T23:23:46.000Z,2026-09-03T23:23:39.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,time-series-forecasting,"**Time is geometry.** The Time-Series Operator (TSO) is a foundation model that learns the *shape* of dynamical systems instead of token-chunking numbers. Pretraining uses four self-supervised pretexts — reconstruction, Koopman-linear dynamics, scale covariance (a renormalization leg), and the arrow of time — on 40 series across 8 domains (electricity grids, meteorology, ECG, finance, epidemiology, economics, solar physics, chaotic systems). Transfer to a never-seen series is a **closed-form Koopman fit on the frozen latent**: zero gradient steps.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v17,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
