Raghav-Singhal/pathlang-1p7b-runA-zh-first,8,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-07-15T11:46:33.000Z,2026-07-15T11:45:56.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,16,text-generation,"A 1.7B-parameter bilingual (English + Chinese) language model, part of a **controlled language-ordering study**. Three models share the *same* architecture, initialization, total data diet (50B English + 50B Chinese = 100B tokens), and LR schedule; they differ **only** in the order in which the two languages are presented during pretraining. This is the **Chinese-first** run.",other,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Raghav-Singhal/pathlang-1p7b-runA-zh-first,noassertion,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
