vukrosic/nano-vowel,8,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-06-30T10:16:39.000Z,2026-06-30T10:16:20.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,text-generation,"Restores the vowels to a vowel-less word — `wrld` → `world`, `dsmvwld` → `disemvoweled`, `brd` → `bread`. Vowel placement lives only in a learned lexicon, so a rule-only script has *nothing to compute*; the model recovers the most likely word a consonant skeleton came from. A **~1M-parameter (1,016,960) byte-level transformer**.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/vukrosic/nano-vowel,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,safetensors,false
