Manovishaal/MaVi-0.2-65M,8,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-10-12T14:37:20.000Z,2026-10-12T14:37:00.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,text-generation,"**MaVi** is a small language model that turns a plain-English game idea into a playable 2D game. It was trained from scratch, together with its own game engine: the model writes **GSL**, a compact game-specification language (see `GSL.md`), and the engine plays it, validates it and exports it to Godot 4 and Ren'Py. It can also draw pixel-art sprites in **PXL**, a small drawing language, and edit existing games and levels.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Manovishaal/MaVi-0.2-65M,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,pytorch,false
