OneScience-Group/AURORA,7,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-08-18T09:55:14.000Z,2026-08-18T09:55:12.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,,"<p align=""center""><strong><span style=""font-size: 30px;"">AURORA</span></strong></p>",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/OneScience-Group/AURORA,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v11,7,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-09-02T21:43:06.000Z,2026-09-02T21:36:42.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,time-series-forecasting,"**Time is geometry.** The Time-Series Operator (TSO) is a foundation model that learns the *shape* of dynamical systems instead of token-chunking numbers. Pretraining uses four self-supervised pretexts — reconstruction, Koopman-linear dynamics, scale covariance (a renormalization leg), and the arrow of time — on 40 series across 8 domains (electricity grids, meteorology, ECG, finance, epidemiology, economics, solar physics, chaotic systems). Transfer to a never-seen series is a **closed-form Koopman fit on the frozen latent**: zero gradient steps.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v11,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
