Chtholly17/epifoundation-compass-dann,6,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-08-19T00:35:24.000Z,2026-08-19T00:35:07.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,13,feature-extraction,"Transformer backbone for paired single-cell **ATAC + RNA** data, pretrained on [CompassDB](https://compass.compbio.duke.edu/) with a **domain-adversarial (DANN)** batch discriminator on the cell embedding.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Chtholly17/epifoundation-compass-dann,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,pytorch,false
Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v13,6,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-09-03T16:27:52.000Z,2026-09-03T16:27:47.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,time-series-forecasting,"**Time is geometry.** The Time-Series Operator (TSO) is a foundation model that learns the *shape* of dynamical systems instead of token-chunking numbers. Pretraining uses four self-supervised pretexts — reconstruction, Koopman-linear dynamics, scale covariance (a renormalization leg), and the arrow of time — on 40 series across 8 domains (electricity grids, meteorology, ECG, finance, epidemiology, economics, solar physics, chaotic systems). Transfer to a never-seen series is a **closed-form Koopman fit on the frozen latent**: zero gradient steps.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Sejibeji/tso-foundation-v13,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-13,6,pretraining,downloads:desc,2021-10-04T04:50:46.000Z,2022-03-02T23:29:04.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,13,,Seed 13 MultiBERTs (pretrained BERT) model on English language using a masked language modeling (MLM) objective. It was introduced in [this paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.16163.pdf) and first released in [this repository](https://github.com/google-research/language/tree/master/language/multiberts). This model is uncased: it does not make a difference between english and English.,apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/MultiBertGunjanPatrick/multiberts-seed-13,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
