anonymous-stoicheia/Stoicheia-fold-1,5,pretrained,downloads:desc,2026-08-02T21:04:32.000Z,2026-08-02T09:20:35.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,fill-mask,"**Stoicheia** is a 405M-parameter character-level masked-diffusion encoder for Ancient Greek (`d_model` 1024, depth 32, banded attention: three of every four blocks attend within a 256-character window, the fourth globally). Its input is factored into five aligned planes -- letters, word/sentence boundaries, diacritics, capitalization, punctuation -- each of which can be masked independently to an explicit *unknown* state at inference. That is what lets one model read an edited text, *scriptio continua*, and a lacuna of unknown length without changing anything but its input.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/anonymous-stoicheia/Stoicheia-fold-1,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
anonymous-stoicheia/Stoicheia-fold-7,5,pretrained,downloads:desc,2026-08-02T21:04:43.000Z,2026-08-02T09:23:31.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,fill-mask,"**Stoicheia** is a 405M-parameter character-level masked-diffusion encoder for Ancient Greek (`d_model` 1024, depth 32, banded attention: three of every four blocks attend within a 256-character window, the fourth globally). Its input is factored into five aligned planes -- letters, word/sentence boundaries, diacritics, capitalization, punctuation -- each of which can be masked independently to an explicit *unknown* state at inference. That is what lets one model read an edited text, *scriptio continua*, and a lacuna of unknown length without changing anything but its input.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/anonymous-stoicheia/Stoicheia-fold-7,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
