mizjaggy18/SegTME-UNI2-UperHoVer_TCGA-UT-012345,5,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-06-20T13:35:24.000Z,2026-05-31T13:13:07.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,23,image-segmentation,"**Stage 3 of 3** in the SegTME-UNI2 progressive pseudo-label curriculum — the final deployed model. Trained from scratch on entropy-filtered pseudo-labels generated by the Stage 2 model (M2, TCGA-UT Scale 0) applied to all 1,608,061 TCGA-UT patches across six resolution scales (0.5–1.0 µm/px).",cc-by-nc-4.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/mizjaggy18/SegTME-UNI2-UperHoVer_TCGA-UT-012345,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,,false
