star-ga/mind-nerve,0,mcp,downloads:desc,2026-08-19T19:12:10.000Z,2026-05-16T10:39:31.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,17,sentence-similarity,"**Every skill available. Few in context.** mind-nerve sits between a user request and the host runtime (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and any MCP-aware client). It reads the request, decides which subset of the available skills / tools / agents / MCP servers is relevant, and hands the host a short top-K list — so the downstream LLM never sees the full library in its system prompt. **Library size decouples from token cost.**",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/star-ga/mind-nerve,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,sentence-transformers,false
