geotessera/TESSERA-V-2.0-2B-N,0,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-08-14T12:54:42.000Z,2026-07-24T15:32:28.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,20,image-feature-extraction,"A compact per-pixel encoder for Sentinel-2 + Sentinel-1 satellite time series, **distilled from the [TESSERA v2 2B teacher](https://huggingface.co/geotessera/TESSERA-V-2.0-2B-Teacher)**. It maps one pixel's annual observation history to a **128-dimensional Matryoshka embedding**: the first K dimensions are independently usable for K ∈ {16, 32, 64, 128}, so you can truncate to 16/32/64 dims with no retraining and no separate checkpoint.",cc0-1.0,cc0,https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/,3,https://huggingface.co/geotessera/TESSERA-V-2.0-2B-N,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,pytorch,false
