akhverm/Klint-32M,0,foundation-model,downloads:desc,2026-09-22T15:07:56.000Z,2026-09-22T12:18:53.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,12,time-series-forecasting,"**Klint-32M** is an open research causal autoregressive foundation architecture for generative financial time-series modeling. It decomposes raw market candlesticks into three stationary causal factor streams (**Price-Path**, **Range-Shape**, and **Activity**), quantizes them into discrete token codes with Residual Vector Quantization (RVQ), models their joint transition distribution with a causal Transformer, and decodes them with strict mathematical guarantees preserving candle geometry:",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/akhverm/Klint-32M,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,pytorch,false
