Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-31b,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-09T09:17:43.000Z,2026-10-09T00:11:22.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,7,,"Training starts with one complete pass over `Ba2han/tokenized_mix_0507` and stops at its exhaustion. The learning-rate schedule spans 31 billion input tokens; the packed long dataset is a later continuation. Two GPUs use 1 packed row each per forward and 32 accumulation passes: 655,360 input tokens per update. Activation checkpointing is disabled. N-gram gradients accumulate in FP32 and communicate in BF16. The full 1.8B n-gram table remains on GPU; measured steady throughput is about 41k input tokens/s. Adam groups use AdamW8bit at a peak LR of 0.001; Muon groups use the selected 8-step Polar Express recipe at 0.024. Warmup lasts 500 updates. Linear decay starts at 24.8 billion input tokens.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-31b,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,,false
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-500,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-09T10:09:26.000Z,2026-10-09T09:24:47.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,5,,"Fresh initialization: 22 layers, hidden width 1152, SwiGLU intermediate width 3168, tied token embedding and LM head. The backbone contains 550,888,224 parameters; the width-64 bigram/trigram table contains 1,800,199,552 parameters. The existing 60,800-token vocabulary is retained. Source data is pinned to `66b78cd134ab7b0545a1a618a1cc029f3091eb20`. Document-aware packing adds BOS/EOS and preserves causal/state isolation with segments no longer than 2,560 tokens.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-500,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,,false
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-v2,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-09T10:51:04.000Z,2026-10-09T10:18:41.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,5,,"22 layers, hidden 1152, intermediate 3168; tied embedding/LM head. Backbone 550,888,224 parameters plus a 1,800,199,552-parameter width-64 bigram/trigram table. Existing 60,800-token vocabulary; context 2,560, four rows per GPU, two GPUs, 32 accumulation passes = 655,360 input tokens/update.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-v2,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,1,,,false
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-2p1b,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-09T11:11:19.000Z,2026-10-09T10:56:10.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,4,,"Speed test stopped on user request after 13 updates (8,519,680 input tokens), without saving weights. This repository contains the recipe and tokenizer; it does not contain a trained 2.1B-table checkpoint. Matching post-warmup updates 6–10 measured 28,719 input tokens/s versus 28,773 for the preceding 1.8B table. Peak allocation 45.705 GB/GPU, about 1.25 GB higher. These are short-sample measurements.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model2-fineweb-2p1b,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,,false
Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model3-short-2b,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-09T11:47:46.000Z,2026-10-09T11:26:17.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,4,,"Fresh training from step zero. Hidden 1024, MLP 2816, head dimension 128; 21 GDN + 7 attention layers, tied embeddings, full-head RoPE theta 10000, pre-norm zero-centered RMSNorm epsilon 1e-6, four gated residual branches. Exact parameters: 2,571,643,424 = 571,494,816 backbone + 2,000,148,608 table.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/Ba2han/mini-qwen-next-model3-short-2b,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,,false
aliwister/ali-llm-safe,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-10T09:59:49.000Z,2026-10-10T09:59:12.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,22,text-generation,"ali-llm-safe is a 2.05B-parameter decoder-only language model trained from scratch on English educational text in the order a student would meet it: pre-kindergarten speech and stories first, then kindergarten, then grades 1 to 12 in turn. Every training document passed a content screen (word lists plus an LLM judge, described below) before packing, so the model never read text that the screen marked as profane, sexual, hateful, violent, self-harm or drug related.",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-safe,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
aliwister/ali-llm-safe-unsafe,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-10T17:32:49.000Z,2026-10-10T17:30:02.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,16,text-generation,"ali-llm-safe-unsafe is [ali-llm-safe](https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-safe) (2.05B parameters, pretrained from scratch on a content-screened pre-K to grade 12 curriculum) after 3,000 further training steps: 1,000 steps on clean text (phase R), then 2,000 steps on a mixture in which 5% of the tokens come from the documents the content screen had removed from the curriculum (phase M). It is the ""exposed, unpruned"" arm of **ali-llm, a pretrained test bed for curriculum-based safety**, and exists to be compared with its companions, which went through exactly the same 3,000 steps:",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-safe-unsafe,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
sh-lee/nanochat-d12-base,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-12T02:02:08.000Z,2026-10-12T02:01:10.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,7,,"A small **base** language model trained with [nanochat](https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat) at commit `d6d86cb` (October 2025) plus a two-line data-loader patch (below). It continues text; it is **not** a chat model and was not fine-tuned or aligned. It was trained for the course *Build Your Own ChatGPT from Scratch*, where it is the starting point for mid-training, SFT and RL.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/sh-lee/nanochat-d12-base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
FINAL-Bench/VKORE-46M-NPU,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-20T02:26:05.000Z,2026-10-14T05:04:13.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,49,text-generation,"> **The common wisdom was absolute: an inference only NPU cannot train. Not even LoRA fine tuning, let alone pretraining from scratch. Its architecture, people said, simply cannot run backpropagation.** > > **This model is the counterexample.**",apache-2.0,,,6,https://huggingface.co/FINAL-Bench/VKORE-46M-NPU,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,27,,transformers,false
aliwister/ali-llm-safety-pruned,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-16T02:38:08.000Z,2026-10-16T02:37:38.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,17,text-generation,"ali-llm-safety-pruned is [ali-llm-safe](https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-safe) with 31% of its feed-forward neurons removed (the least active ones, by importance measured on the curriculum), taking it from 2.05B to 1.54B parameters, and then trained for the same 3,000 steps as its companions: 1,000 steps on clean text (phase R), then 2,000 steps on a mixture in which 5% of the tokens come from the documents the content screen had removed from the curriculum (phase M). It is the ""pruned, then exposed"" arm of **ali-llm, a pretrained test bed for curriculum-based safety**:",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-safety-pruned,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
aliwister/ali-llm-baseline,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-16T02:38:39.000Z,2026-10-16T02:38:11.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,14,text-generation,"ali-llm-baseline is a 1.54B-parameter model trained from scratch on exactly the same packed training rows, in the same order and with the same schedule, as [ali-llm-safe](https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-safe) (2.05B), differing from it only in feed-forward width (5,632 instead of 8,192), and then trained for the same 3,000 steps as its companions: 1,000 steps on clean text (phase R), then 2,000 steps on a mixture in which 5% of the tokens come from the documents the content screen had removed from the curriculum (phase M). It is the size-matched control of **ali-llm, a pretrained test bed for curriculum-based safety**:",apache-2.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/aliwister/ali-llm-baseline,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,transformers,false
KvaytG/rubert-tiny2-onnx,0,pretraining,downloads:desc,2026-10-19T11:45:07.000Z,2026-10-19T11:39:33.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,15,feature-extraction,"ONNX version of [`cointegrated/rubert-tiny2`](https://huggingface.co/cointegrated/rubert-tiny2), a compact Russian language model.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/KvaytG/rubert-tiny2-onnx,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,transformers,false
