tchauffi/diffusionlm-from-scratch,0,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-06-29T16:51:57.000Z,2026-06-29T16:24:09.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,10,text-generation,"A masked (absorbing-state) **diffusion language model**, built and trained from scratch on TinyStories. Instead of generating left-to-right one token at a time, it starts from a sequence of pure `[MASK]` tokens and **denoises the whole sequence in parallel** — committing the tokens it is most confident about first, in whatever order the meaning falls into place.",,,,3,https://huggingface.co/tchauffi/diffusionlm-from-scratch,no,no,,,full,neither,,,tag,0,,pytorch,false
