mxv456/klitzeklein-europarl-translator,0,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-09-14T13:07:58.000Z,2026-09-14T13:07:44.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,translation,"*klitzeklein* (German): teeny-tiny. Four transformer translators of 23–25M parameters, trained **from scratch** on Europarl on a single RTX 3060, from the research repo **https://github.com/Marvel4U/klitzeklein-europarl-translator** — a systematic small-scale comparison of specialization vs. general pretraining, encoder-decoder vs. decoder-only, language direction and architecture. Read the repo README for the full results, findings and limitations; this card documents the weights.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/mxv456/klitzeklein-europarl-translator,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,pytorch,false
