oli-mebberson/lattice-cadence,0,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-09-17T07:29:18.000Z,2026-09-17T07:26:07.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,7,,"Cadence is a 26M-parameter decoder-only transformer, trained from scratch on MIDI music. Given a short text prompt (tempo, time signature, instrument), it composes original multi-track MIDI under a grammar-constrained sampler that keeps every generation structurally valid.",cc-by-4.0,,,3,https://huggingface.co/oli-mebberson/lattice-cadence,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,1,,pytorch,false
javimosch/mtlm-7m-base,0,from-scratch,downloads:desc,2026-09-18T07:05:43.000Z,2026-09-18T07:05:39.000Z,2026-10-20 14:27:33,11,,"**MTLM** (machin tiny language model) is an experiment in building an LLM with no ML framework at all: the tokenizer training, the pretraining loop (AdamW, RoPE, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, tied embeddings), the int8 export and the inference server are all written in [machin](https://github.com/javimosch/machin) (MFL, a machine-first language that compiles to C), and the whole thing was trained on a 6-core CPU shared with other services.",mit,,,3,https://huggingface.co/javimosch/mtlm-7m-base,yes,no,,,full,api_only,,,tag,0,,,false
